:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":299,"start":184,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:289"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:20","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:20:p00005","text":"己夹云宝玉亦知医理，却只是在颦、钗等人前方露，亦如后回许多\n明理之语，只在闺前现露三分，越在雨村等经济人前如痴如呆，实令人可恨。但\n雨村等视宝玉不是人物，岂知宝玉视彼等更不是人物，故不与接谈也。宝玉之情\n痴，真乎？假乎？看官细评。","text_sha256":"281a3c91830d228d2b4cb94b66591438353fb2250f9c212018f78e0dfc762d86"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":184,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说宝玉在林黛玉房中说“耗子精”，宝钗撞来，讽刺宝\n玉元宵不知“绿蜡”之典，三人正在房中互相讥刺取笑。那宝\n玉正恐黛玉饭后贪眠，一时存了食，或夜间走了困，皆非保养\n身体之法；","extraction_text_sha256":"9680c0a8118259bb3351b9e4b2a4101a4e2378a4e5f5b441d4a4505218d9ae80","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":288,"physical_page_one_based":289,"start":93,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:289","viewer_fragment":"#page=289"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 20","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:20:p00004","text_sha256":"007e05d9e4601f2c38a19aba78bb1a4f37945f0858d98ddba01cf945b8570fb1"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":20,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":184,"start":93,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:289"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:20","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:20:p00004","text":" \n  话说宝玉在林黛玉房中说“耗子精”，宝钗撞来，讽刺宝\n玉元宵不知“绿蜡”之典，三人正在房中互相讥刺取笑。那宝\n玉正恐黛玉饭后贪眠，一时存了食，或夜间走了困，皆非保养\n身体之法；","text_sha256":"007e05d9e